        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                "word": "inéluctable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "00bb56c3-54a9-4857-93b4-6c62ddc1c676",
                        "entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "inéluctables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                        "entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie quelque chose qui est inévitable, fatal et qu’aucune force ne saurait détourner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "47f05daa-e19a-4910-8643-bfa7134e8637",
                                "sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                                "text": "Et puis, si aucun cataclysme soudain n'a décisivement transformé l'aspect naturel des choses, d'un seul coup, depuis un siècle, il est cependant vrai qu'au ralenti une catastrophe inéluctable impose à cette partie de la France, cette fatale loi d’impermanence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3407c97a-6e3f-4e8e-9d76-2c5502a472c4",
                                "sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                                "text": "D'une part, on est volontiers amené à restreindre les cas jugés inopérables puisque l’inopérabilité sous-entend une mort prochaine quasi inéluctable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b2abbd9-ce1e-4b5a-839e-1e31b6152dec",
                                "sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                                "text": "A un fouriériste ardennais qui constate une lutte des classes inéluctable, il répond : pas d'antagonisme sous le régime de la liberté économique, il y a intérêt pour les deux parties à se rencontrer pour discuter des salaires."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aacba1dc-ccff-432f-b253-74674bba0aa3",
                                "sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                                "text": "Mais cette histoire du succès du système social occidental ne doit pas non plus être considérée comme l’histoire d’un progrès humain inéluctable."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1f18c2b9-3bab-4695-a42b-1d1f796ead79",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "source_sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                        "target_lang_word": "unweigerlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unweigerlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d672de5f-7069-37ca-9bfc-0b096efbf2f6",
                                        "entry_id": "0def3eaa-094b-32cf-a275-6e54fa585a86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zweifellos/unvermeidbar eintretend; unmittelbar folgend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9fd17f1-8db1-49f2-96e1-4f2648fb5222",
                                                "sense_id": "d672de5f-7069-37ca-9bfc-0b096efbf2f6",
                                                "text": "Das Getrolle führt unweigerlich zu einer Sperre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c53274b-f0f2-4bf6-892f-bbde13a7eeb5",
                                                "sense_id": "d672de5f-7069-37ca-9bfc-0b096efbf2f6",
                                                "text": "„Natürlich fürchtet sich die CDU vor dem unweigerlichen Machtverlust und kämpft mit allen Mitteln dagegen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b3199dc-a4f0-4c57-a242-e0cc7a74ef55",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "source_sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                        "target_lang_word": "unabwendbar",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unabwendbar",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9868f47f-4ace-3d8b-a807-7b344cd96a72",
                                        "entry_id": "c1655784-39b4-3536-886f-9ed7a0e1c07c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicht zu verhindern(d)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3efc43e8-1cf3-4ae1-959c-267d2edaa718",
                                                "sense_id": "9868f47f-4ace-3d8b-a807-7b344cd96a72",
                                                "text": "„Wissen Sie, dass ich an Schicksal glaube? Ich meine an echtes, unabwendbares Schicksal?“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56ac0151-9e35-4d1c-b131-fb26dbda0594",
                                                "sense_id": "9868f47f-4ace-3d8b-a807-7b344cd96a72",
                                                "text": "„Die Kirchen sind also nicht auf dem Weg in den märchenhaften Reichtum - sie gewinnen gerade Zeit, sich auf einen Wandel einzustellen, der unabwendbar kommen wird: […]“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e043c07a-c740-4a14-8830-e78839793cfe",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "source_sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                        "target_lang_word": "inevitable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inevitable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e434a2c4-1f13-30db-a9e2-3d81430c44fe",
                                        "entry_id": "e2e0be27-467c-38d5-adc2-5c61ac89f40f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible to avoid or prevent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d27e9d9-ac1d-4634-884c-6523bbaf7178",
                                                "sense_id": "e434a2c4-1f13-30db-a9e2-3d81430c44fe",
                                                "text": "We were going so fast that the collision was inevitable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9132ed1e-a6f6-4b76-8ca8-d7475af0f12c",
                                                "sense_id": "e434a2c4-1f13-30db-a9e2-3d81430c44fe",
                                                "text": "It was inevitable that such a system should lead to the wide use of nicknames to distinguish identically named members of a family[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c102b98-6b41-4bc0-9762-99b11e02c437",
                                                "sense_id": "e434a2c4-1f13-30db-a9e2-3d81430c44fe",
                                                "text": "To do the job thoroughly sentiment must be ignored and it seems inevitable that the famous Great Hall and the Doric Arch will have to be sacrificed to progress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b03b02d-756d-388f-b034-87fe5bcfc67f",
                                        "entry_id": "e2e0be27-467c-38d5-adc2-5c61ac89f40f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Predictable or always happening."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da2944a4-303c-4c06-acbb-041b4dd9df26",
                                                "sense_id": "3b03b02d-756d-388f-b034-87fe5bcfc67f",
                                                "text": "My outburst met with the inevitable punishment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4393c49-7ba4-44dd-b4a6-bbb6a6333b61",
                                                "sense_id": "3b03b02d-756d-388f-b034-87fe5bcfc67f",
                                                "text": "Every break seemed dangerous and Falcao clearly had the beating of Amorebieta. Others, being forced to stretch a foot behind them to control Arda Turan's 34th-minute cross, might simply have lashed a shot on the turn; Falcao, though, twisted back on to his left foot, leaving Amorebieta in a heap, and thumped in an inevitable finish – his 12th goal in 15 European matches this season."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e994856-849b-43a3-b534-882f0d659360",
                                                "sense_id": "3b03b02d-756d-388f-b034-87fe5bcfc67f",
                                                "text": "This horse and rider, with their free, rhythmical gallop, were the only moving things to be seen on the face of the flat country. They seemed, in the last sad light of evening, not to be there accidentally, but as an inevitable detail of the landscape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "inevitable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75d0d8f9-96b6-3a41-a087-64e3c0b96457",
                                        "entry_id": "14570075-9c51-3dca-a09e-9be1c5a31c73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is predictable, necessary, or cannot be avoided."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37671934-29c4-4e25-b39e-c2476bff4ecd",
                                                "sense_id": "75d0d8f9-96b6-3a41-a087-64e3c0b96457",
                                                "text": "I pass also the jealousies, the quarrels, the disgusts, that make the catholic questions and corn-bills of married life—and only dwell on one particular: some irresistible hat, some adorable cap, some exquisite robe, has rather elongated your milliner's list of inevitables..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36c40162-dfa6-4d57-ae60-0cdc6a7493be",
                                                "sense_id": "75d0d8f9-96b6-3a41-a087-64e3c0b96457",
                                                "text": "In the migratory patterns of the city's art scenes, there are two inevitables: First, that neighbourhoods where art makes its home become instantly more attractive; and second, because of it, art won't be at home for long."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8b6e3106-daeb-4286-a550-0254363d5a8d",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "source_sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                        "target_lang_word": "ineluctable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ineluctable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                        "entry_id": "772d9a33-0063-31c5-bd3f-586a49a9a244",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible to avoid or escape; inescapable, irresistible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8168b939-af8a-4ae9-b041-19d42cacdd7c",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "God indeed (if it please him) can by his absolute power over his Creature, make him act this thing, or take that thing, by ineluctable Necessity, and whether he will or no."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae9e43b3-5c41-4cf5-98a0-d090161b2e97",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "They have come under the yoke of ineluctable slavery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac11b57f-12a1-4671-9025-895b44ba63a7",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "He was aware instantly of an opposition in his members, unanimous and invincible, clinging to life with a single and fixed resolve, finger by finger, sinew by sinew; something that was at once he and not he—at once within and without him;—the shutting of some miniature valve in his brain, which a single manly thought should suffice to open—and the grasp of an external fate ineluctable as gravity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd282418-94f4-4430-a8d3-6d2e29bbc309",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "I throw this ended shadow from me, manshape ineluctable, call it back."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9e3ffee-0e63-48ce-b262-94d990ca0d7d",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "For the self-regulating market was now believed to follow from the inexorable laws of Nature, and the unshackling of the market to be an ineluctable necessity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36aa60ad-3c2d-4c43-9c98-3e83f01e138a",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "Captain Kirk! And the ineluctible Mr. Spock. Welcome to Motherlode, gentlemen. Interested in purchasing a little love?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b70b37eb-8b50-4640-afb3-26a3b6b3bb54",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "Out in the street, under the reddening afternoon sun, a spectacle of ineluctable commerce greeted her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02f004de-da50-4aca-8846-819730daf06b",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "[…] The first will be the ineluctable fact of climate change."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b90a24c8-7fba-44c1-8bc8-75701501632a",
                                                "sense_id": "413fb230-da0c-378c-877d-966069e6d713",
                                                "text": "As we've seen, the Manifesto’s argument for the ineluctable impoverishment of the working class under capitalism, for example, has not been borne out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "97b513c8-76c4-4fdb-8254-05c67472ac2f",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcf50930-9672-3437-82da-3eb5a19e6e10",
                        "source_sense_id": "8b9627b6-8d89-3d5e-857e-3bda86a19523",
                        "target_lang_word": "inescapable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inescapable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9687f46-1b56-36b9-86d5-ef9e91e8c79a",
                                        "entry_id": "a6ed1c9c-ba2f-3750-98a2-7395d2e53bc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible (unable) to avoid or escape; not escapable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7daba732-1c79-4674-90e8-af1f4e986e06",
                                                "sense_id": "c9687f46-1b56-36b9-86d5-ef9e91e8c79a",
                                                "text": "Later, the US national security adviser, Jake Sullivan, told CNN that Ukraine could not join Nato immediately as it was “an inescapable fact” that the treaty’s mutual defence clause would mean allies would be obliged to enter a direct war with Russia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8623aecc-0c71-4c24-8d8a-461d536bdda3",
                                                "sense_id": "c9687f46-1b56-36b9-86d5-ef9e91e8c79a",
                                                "text": "The Rugby flyover, too, is now an inescapable feature of the West Coast main line landscape."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a06143d-a5e1-477e-b0c1-f975f7c384d9",
                                                "sense_id": "c9687f46-1b56-36b9-86d5-ef9e91e8c79a",
                                                "text": "Wages absorbed 80% of the total revenue (which was inescapable), and they were rising at almost twice the rate of fares, which were pegged by law."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e521f29-c191-4243-9d92-e682a0a7276d",
